  "paradigm_pack_notes": "The Red Chocobo is a Commando. It gains balanced stats and learns many passive abilities, such as Fire Resistance and Critical: Bravery. The latter may be a good addition, since the party is unable to manually bestow Bravery (unless cast through a monster like a Gigantuar). It also learns Stagger Maintenance II, extending the duration of stagger. As with all chocobos, the player with one Red Chocobo and its crystal may obtain another Red Chocobo crystal due to the chocobo racing minigame. All other tameable monsters are limited to one each. The Red Chocobo can have the highest Attack value of any Paradigm Pack monster, including DLC, if he is raised with Power Materials only. With the +35% Strength Passive, he will surpass 1600 Strength, making him and Twilight Odin the only two Commandos who can exceed 1600 Strength.",
